  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lower Mekong Initiative (LMI) Regional Working Meeting (non-travel)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Total costs not related to travel for LMI Regional Working Group Meetings. Building on the Busan Declaration for Aid Effectiveness, the LMI Working Groups, consisting of government officials from various ministries, will discuss project ideas and develop joint concepts that can be incorporated into our program development. The working groups meet in-region twice a year to determine new policy, coordinate program development with LMI regional partners, and update the joint action plan. In addition to covering venue and related administrative costs, funding will be used to cover costs of LMI partner country participants, including travel and lodging, ensuring that these governments can bring the necessary working and mid-level officials from various line ministries, and thereby emphasizing the whole-of-government partnership approach through LMI.</narrative>
  </description>
